<section>
    <section id="pdf-accessibility">
        <h1>What is an accessible PDF document?</h1>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>Same principles as for web pages</h2>
    </section>
    <section>
        <ul>
        <li>Language properly defined</li>
        <li>Meaningful title</li>
        <li>Enough contrast</li>
        <li>Readable font (not WCAG) </li>
        <li>Understandable without colors</li>
        <li>Alternative texts for images</li>
        <li>Logical reading order</li>
        <li>Tags to provide structure</li>
        <li>Readable after Reflow</li>
        <li>Easy to read (not WCAG)</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</section>
